<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] — Калькулятор</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 700px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #17212b; }
        main { background: #f4f7fb; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; }
        form { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; }
        input, select, button { font: inherit; padding: .65rem; border: 1px solid #9ba9b8; border-radius: 7px; }
        input { width: 9rem; } button { background: #155eef; color: white; border-color: #155eef; cursor: pointer; }
        .result { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; } .error, .validation-summary-errors { color: #a11919; }
        footer { margin-top: 2rem; color: #526171; font-size: .9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>@RenderBody()</main>
    <footer>Студент № 13 · ФИО: Низовцев Дмитрий Алексеевич · Группа: НМТ-433901</footer>
</body>
</html>
